{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobjH9FrL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobAX1SDD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7d00xr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は 夜桜さんちの大作戦 のキャラ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夜桜二刃ちゃんを意識して高めのツインテール🎀"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobGN7CzI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れなさんと目が合う時はどうしても胸がドキドキしちゃって、好きだって実感させられます"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobpTRdbh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「いるとウザイしそこにいなきゃ困る」のところ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつりさんと向かい合って踊ってるのだけど、怒ってる顔がとっても可愛くてたまに思い出します"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobL7ZJRJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "複数人で自撮りをするのが好きだからたまに無言でカメラを向けます"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何も言わずポーズしてくれます、嬉しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近のミーグリの写真をすこし💌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobm8xzvY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobM90fWh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob5WehY3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はガーリーな気分だったので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さくらんぼ柄のワンピースにしたよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhjJbc6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobq3qgRS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobOxGWu3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob88N2kz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはデニムを履きたくなった2日間👖"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobIqhan4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今日はシンプルなお洋服にしたよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は会える約束がたくさんで嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい〜って伝えてくれる姿が愛おしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "顔がほどける瞬間とか"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "笑顔になったときとか"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早口で想いを伝えてくれたり"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "プロポーズしてくれたり 笑"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たまに涙してくれたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "えーありがとう〜笑 ってつい言っちゃうのは照れ隠しで、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとから何回も思い出してる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごくすごく嬉しく思ってる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もありがとうーーー！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobP1y3ac.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またねっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobOIrccT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobJLbUWa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♩"}], "source": "official"}